<cl=F0F010>Guide:<cl=00FF00> Alchemy is difficult to learn, but ready-made potions are easy to use.<br><br>

<cl=FFFFFF>If you bought a health powder, move it to your hand to use.<br>
Press Alt and the left mouse button at the same time to use the powder on yourself.<br><br>
